# NTNH Server - Git attributes
#
# server.jar and minecraft_server.1.7.10.jar are committed as real files so fresh
# installs never need to download them.
#
# The HBM mod jar is ~112 MB and exceeds GitHub's per-file size limit, so it must
# stay in Git LFS. start.sh / start.bat / resolve-lfs.py fetch the real file from
# GitHub's LFS object API at install time (no git-lfs install required).
mods/HBM-*.jar filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
